<mxCell id="stSD" value="&lt;b&gt;SwiftData ModelContainer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application Support/MaynardGolf.store · CloudKit .private(iCloud.{bundle id})&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Schema: MaynardSchemaV1 (Player, Round, RoundEntry) · #Index on Round dates&lt;br&gt;MaynardMigrationPlan: no stages yet&lt;br&gt;Persistent history (fetchHistory + token) · @ModelActor BackgroundStore&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;No data migration: every install starts with an empty store. Leftovers from earlier development builds (default.store, Documents/pics) are deleted on first launch.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="lStore"><mxGeometry x="20" y="46" width="520" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
